# A counted loop: sum 1..5 and print the total.
#
# The loop exits on a comparison of a value the program computed, which is what
# Lt/Gt/Eq and friends make possible.

# slot 0: running total, slot 1: counter
0 StoreVar 0
5 StoreVar 1

.loop
LoadVar 1 0 Gt
JumpIfFalse .done
  LoadVar 0 LoadVar 1 + StoreVar 0
  LoadVar 1 1 - StoreVar 1
Jump .loop

.done
LoadVar 0
io.print CallNative 1
